OL,3,GNEWSAAlex Warren to headline music
OL,4,Afestival
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrammy award-nominated singer Alex
OL,7,FWarren has been announced as the first
OL,8,Fheadliner for a music festival.
OL,10,FWarren will top the bill at Live at
OL,11,FPowderham 2027 on 26 June. The four-day
OL,12,Fmusic festival, which takes place at
OL,13,FPowderham Castle, near Exeter, runs
OL,14,Ffrom 24 to 27 June.
OL,16,FWarren's appearance follows a
OL,17,Fbreakthrough period for the US star,
OL,18,Fwhose second album, Wildchild, reached
OL,19,Fnumber one in several countries
OL,20,Fincluding the UK and US.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
