OL,3,GNEWSAAlex Warren to headline music
OL,4,Afestival
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis hit single Ordinary became one of
OL,7,Fthe biggest songs of 2025 and helped
OL,8,Festablish him as one of pop music's
OL,9,Ffastest-rising artists, said festival
OL,10,Forganisers.
